; AdaptiveMultiStrategyEA - index sleeves (entry mode 8, chapter 93). No specific days and no time-of-day habits are used for decisions.
; For an index CFD account (OANDA: a separate sub-account from FX). Symbol names differ by broker/account: check the log line
; "[AMS] 口座にある銘柄" on the first run and edit the two lists below.
; Mean reversion (long only, published rules, unchanged numbers): R2 / D7 / IBS on the three US indices.
; Trend (long only): hold while the close is above the 200-day average, reviewed every 7 days, on six indices.
; Sizing: each active rule adds a position whose own volatility is 2.7% of equity per year (reversion sleeve about 10% per year
; with 3 indices x 3 rules); each trend position 2.7% (trend sleeve about 10% per year with 6 indices).
; Attach to a chart of any symbol in the account (H1).
InpEntryMode=8
InpIxRevSymbols=US500,US100,US30
InpIxTrendSymbols=US500,US100,US30,JP225,DE30,UK100
InpIxRuleR2=true
InpIxRuleD7=true
InpIxRuleIBS=true
InpIxRevUnitVol=2.7
InpIxTrendUnitVol=2.7
InpIxTrendCheckDays=7
InpIxMaxLev=5.0
InpIxBand=0.25
InpIxSLVolMul=0.0
InpIxDelayMin=5
InpIxMaxSpreadPct=0.05
InpMaxMarginUsePct=80.0
